  attribute :>> exitCondition="Full408 interpreted and current argument-only8-build/16-execution populations are measured on d07. All samples, native process RSS/footprint and observed regressions are retained. Owner propagation now terminates on finite frozen graphs, including cyclic/NaN cases; scratch/leases/lookups are explicit costs. This is correctness and bounded-work benefit with measured overhead, not a speedup gate. Whole cold build and aggregate peak remain unmeasured outside this REV.";
